WEBVTT

00:00:58.190 --> 00:01:00.381
ukifanya kwa upendo,
pesa huja hata hivyo.

00:01:00.866 --> 00:01:03.976
Kazi! Rupert Murdoch aliniambia, "Yote ni kazi ngumu.

00:01:04.000 --> 00:01:07.083
Hakuna kitu kinakuja kwa urahisi.
Lakini ninaifurahia kazi yangu. "

00:01:07.107 --> 00:01:09.977
Amesema furaha? Rupert? Ndiyo!

00:01:10.001 --> 00:01:11.477
(Vicheko)

00:01:11.501 --> 00:01:14.247
WanaTED hufurahia kazi zao.
Na hufanya kazi kwa bidii.

00:01:14.271 --> 00:01:17.224
Niligundua, sio workaholics. Ni workafrolics.

00:01:17.248 --> 00:01:18.838
(Vicheko)

00:01:18.862 --> 00:01:19.919
Vyema!

00:01:19.943 --> 00:01:20.944
(Makofi)

00:01:20.968 --> 00:01:24.314
Alex Garden anasema, "Ili kufanikiwa, weka jitihada katika kitu kimoja

00:01:24.338 --> 00:01:25.584
na kuwa mtaalamu kwenye hilo."

00:01:25.608 --> 00:01:28.450
Hakuna mazingaombwe;
ni mazoezi, mazoezi, mazoezi.

00:01:28.474 --> 00:01:29.493
Na ni lengo.

00:01:29.517 --> 00:01:31.251
Norman Jewison aliniambia,